{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《璀璨之城》戲骨鬥戲掀起高潮！昨晚（3日）張智霖與江美儀一場「笑住對質」的戲份張力爆棚，二人表面笑意盈盈，對白卻句句攞命，火花四濺的演技讓網民看到頭皮發麻，更激讚只有張智霖才能接住江美儀的戲，究竟這兩大魔頭的對決有多震撼？\n</p>\n<h2>江美儀霸氣挑機認屈人：我擺明屈你架</h2>\n<p>劇情講述被丁麗明（江美儀飾）誣陷推落樓梯的孝賢（張智霖飾），主動上門與她「講數」。丁麗明一見面即劈頭挑機：「我依家廢咗架喇，你係咪好心涼呀？」面對如此直接的挑釁，孝賢亦笑著反擊：「你都幾好笑，無端端話我推你落樓梯，搞到我自己都唔知自己有冇做過，我使唔使同你 say sorry？」沒想到丁麗明竟毫不掩飾，直接承認：「我新抱推我落樓架嘛，我擺明屈你架。」理直氣壯的態度令人心寒。</p>\n<h2>張智霖奪命威脅 江美儀狂笑反擊：我連你阿媽都夠膽毒死</h2>\n<p>面對丁麗明一再挑釁，孝賢終按捺不住，發出奪命威脅：「你信唔信我殺咗你？」豈料丁麗明不但沒被嚇倒，反而先是藐嘴一笑，再大聲乾笑兩聲後突然變臉，惡狠狠地說：「我連你阿媽都夠膽毒死，我會驚你？」二人誰也不怕誰的氣場，最終以一陣詭異的對笑結束對峙。孝賢更一把捉住丁麗明的頭，以示自己的上風位置，而丁麗明則全程笑著睥睨對方「迎戰」，炸裂級的演技讓整個場口充滿張力。</p>\n<h2>網民睇到頭皮發麻：二人演技大賞</h2>\n<p>這場戲播出後，網民隨即瘋狂洗版，激讚兩位演員的頂級演技。不少人留言表示：「兩大魔頭相視而笑真係睇到起晒雞皮」、「平靜的對話，但我看到頭皮發麻」、「『搞到我自己都唔知自己有冇做過』呢句好絕，壞事做得太多自己也記不清楚」、「江美儀的戲只有張智霖接得住，二人演技大賞！」更有趣的是，二人頭貼頭的一幕竟引發網民討論CP感，建議相差僅一個月的他們下部劇可以演情侶：「二人同場對戲太好看」、「求下套劇組CP！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_10109693966aeabd0e200ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_10109693966aeabd0e200ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_11173793526aeabd1159cef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_11173793526aeabd1159cef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_3575165326aeabd148a5e4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_3575165326aeabd148a5e4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_4284826896aeabd17de3bc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_4284826896aeabd17de3bc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_15498534256aeabd1b1ef1a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_15498534256aeabd1b1ef1a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_20809306176aeabd2ca8e9f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_20809306176aeabd2ca8e9f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_18252554916aeabd305052e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_18252554916aeabd305052e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_11423852796aeabd337eb67.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_11423852796aeabd337eb67.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:25:40.816643+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1047,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:00:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:46.834181+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T09:18:46.077860+00:00","content_hash":"d167257374129b6ec8104ee07568d78ca75eb41f4bf0b4261ffd8c4944a3fb73","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}